    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Important caveats",
      "options": {
        "content": "### Important Caveats\n\n- **Median earnings are historical outcomes for past completers, not salary guarantees.**\n- **Median debt ≠ total cost of attendance.** Debt reflects federal loans taken, not tuition.\n- Data represents only students who received **federal financial aid**.\n- **Privacy suppression** removes programs with small cohorts (~96% of raw rows removed).\n- Data may be **several years behind** current labor-market conditions.\n- Programs with the same CIP code can differ significantly between institutions.\n- School, major, and credential do **not cause** a particular salary outcome.\n- Location, occupation, experience, internships, economic conditions, and individual circumstances all affect earnings.\n- This dashboard provides **educational scenario information** and does not provide personalized financial advice.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 57,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "transparent": false,
      "description": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Known limitations\n- Historical earnings **do not guarantee** future salary.\n- Median debt is **not the same as cost of attendance**.\n- School and major **do not cause** a particular income.\n- Some records are **suppressed for privacy** (about 96% of raw rows have no published earnings or debt).\n- Data **lags** current market conditions by several years.\n- **State tax rules change** over time; only 10 states are verified.\n- **Company, occupation, location and experience** affect earnings.\n- Estimates are **educational planning information**, not personalized financial or tax advice.\n- Only undergraduate credentials appear in the cleaned data.\n- 74 schools in the Field of Study file are missing from the Institution file, so their state and address show as *Not reported*.",
